img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000225000</span>225<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">6 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Sharn_Syndicate\" title=\"The Sharn Syndicate\">The Sharn Syndicate</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +2 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Chilling\" title=\"Chilling\">Chilling 2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Chilling\" title=\"Chilling\">Chilling 2</a>:</b> This effect causes the edges of this weapon to become frozen to the touch, dealing 2d6 Ice damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Doubleshot\" title=\"Doubleshot\"> Doubleshot 2%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Doubleshot\" title=\"Doubleshot\"> Doubleshot 2%</a>:</b> Passive: 2% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Doubleshot. (Doubleshot is a chance to score an additional hit with a ranged attack.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deadly\" title=\"Deadly\"> Deadly +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deadly\" title=\"Deadly\"> Deadly +3</a>:</b> +3 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to weapon damage.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Nicked_Repeating_Light_Crossbow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Nicked_Repeating_Light_Crossbow.png/420px-Nicked_Repeating_Light_Crossbow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"434\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Nicked_Repeating_Light_Crossbow.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A complex weapon consisting of a light crossbow and a clip for bolts that is loaded by pulling the reloading lever.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><s>The weapon is bugged and does not work. (<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forums-old.ddo.com/forums/showthread.php/488357\">DDO Forums</a></span>&#160;<sup id=\"old&#95;forums&#95;link&#95;1\" style=\"background-color: #FFAAAA;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/save/https%3A%2F%2Fforums-old.ddo.com%2Fforums%2Fshowthread.php%2F488357\"><abbr title=\"The old forums this link points to were shut down on August 31st, 2025. If this is important, please consider revising the template call as described at &#91;&#91;Template:Forums&#93;&#93;.\" style=\"display: initial;\">ARCHIVE ME!</abbr></a></sup>) </s> <small>Should be fixed with <a href=\"/page/Update_36_Patch_2_Release_Notes#Items\" title=\"Update 36 Patch 2 Release Notes\">Update 36 Patch 2</a>.</small>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817035707\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.118 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.160 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3822/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28785/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7739/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n104.02%  142.872     49 Template:IO\n100.00%  137.350      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  137.350      1 -total\n 97.09%  133.351      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 34.85%   47.861      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 33.88%   46.540      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 32.20%   44.222      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.09%   42.702      2 Template:InCategory\n 28.48%   39.117      6 Template:Popup\n 21.77%   29.898      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddow